# ---- PrivacyGuard: never commit anything that could hold private data ----------
# Rules and settings live in %APPDATA%\PrivacyGuard, outside the repo. These patterns
# are a safety net in case a copy or a diagnostics dump ever lands in the project.
rules.dat
rules.dat.*
settings.json
error.log
engine.log
*.gray
dump/
exposed/
